sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: If the CSMS is able to send a GetDisplayMessage with an unknown id
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: A display message is configured
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: N/a

    CSMS->>CS: GetDisplayMessagesRequest (id, requestId)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: Message GetDisplayMessagesRequest<br>- id = A different generated Id<br>- requestId = Generated Id

    CS-->>CSMS: GetDisplayMessagesResponse (status = Unknown)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
